    and at several other special points, obtaining values in
    the range ``[-pi, pi]``:

    >>> np.arctan2([1., -1.], [0., 0.])
    array([ 1.57079633, -1.57079633])
    >>> np.arctan2([0., 0., np.inf], [+0., -0., np.inf])
    array([0.        , 3.14159265, 0.78539816])

    """)

