    `f32`, `bf16` to `f32`, `f32` to `f64` \
    <code>Vec&lt;D&gt; **PromoteUpperTo**(D, V v)</code>: returns `v[i]` widened
    to `MakeWide<T>`, for i in `[Lanes(D()), 2 * Lanes(D()))`. Note that `V` has
