The following may be more convenient or efficient than also calling `ConcatEven`
or `ConcatOdd` followed by `PromoteLowerTo`:

*   `V`:`{u,i}{8,16,32},f{16,32},bf16`, `D`:`RepartitionToWide<DFromV<V>>` \
